    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s6",
   "title": "Part (iii)",
   "text": "**Review Q9 (iii) (36.12 × 750.9) / (113.2 × 9.98)**  \\[\\begin{aligned}&\\text{Estimate: }\\frac{36\\times 750}{113\\times 10}\\approx \\\\[5pt]&\\quad 27,\\frac{000}{1},130\\approx 24.\\\\[5pt]&\\text{Let x = (36.12 $\\times$ 750.9) /}\\\\[5pt]&\\quad (113.2\\times 9.98)\\\\[5pt]&\\text{Take }\\log \\text{ of both sides: }\\log x=\\log \\\\[5pt]&\\quad 36.12+\\log 750.9-\\\\[5pt]&\\quad (\\log 113.2+\\log 9.98)\\\\[5pt]&\\quad =\\log 36.12+\\log 750.9-\\log 113.2-\\\\[5pt]&\\quad \\log 9.98\\end{aligned}\\]",
   "actions": [
